OL,3,AEA adds AI-generated John Motson to FC
OL,4,A27 video game
OL,5,
OL,6,FFootball game EA Sports FC will feature
OL,7,Fthe digitally recreated voice of the
OL,8,Flate commentator John Motson,
OL,9,FElectronic Arts has exclusively told
OL,10,Fthe BBC.
OL,12,FMotson, who died in 2023, was the main
OL,13,Fcommentator for BBC Sport for decades -
OL,14,Fand performed the same role for the
OL,15,Fvideo game series during the 90s and
OL,16,F00s.
OL,18,FIt is the first time the hit series,
OL,19,Fformerly known as Fifa, has featured a
OL,20,Fdeceased commentator.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
