OL,3,AHundreds complain about 'bullying
OL,4,Abehaviour' on I'm A Celebrity
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 800 people have complained to
OL,7,Fthe media regulator about an episode of
OL,8,FITV reality show I'm A Celebrity... Get
OL,9,FMe Out of Here! in which Mariella
OL,10,FFrostrup accused her campmate AJ Odudu
OL,11,Fof being "aggressive".
OL,13,FTensions first flared between the pair
OL,14,Fas they were seen cooking together on
OL,15,FSaturday, before both were reduced to
OL,16,Ftears when the friction escalated the
OL,17,Ffollowing morning.
OL,19,FOfcom said 887 people had filed
OL,20,Fcomplaints about Sunday's episode in
OL,21,Frelation to "alleged bullying
OL,22,Fbehaviour" by Frostrup towards Odudu.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
