OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AHundreds complain about 'bullying
OL,4,Abehaviour' on I'm A Celebrity
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pair were seen clearing the air on
OL,7,FTuesday, with broadcaster Frostrup
OL,8,Fsaying she was "sorry for calling you
OL,9,Faggressive" and Odudu telling her it is
OL,10,F"a strong word to use in casual
OL,11,Fscenarios, particularly towards black
OL,12,Fwomen".
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
